{"availability":"available","full":"MyThemeWay/mtw-boilerplate-graphics","name":"mtw-boilerplate-graphics","description":"Combo of esbuild, GLSLX, three.js... to develop/build quickly + easily WebGL canvas bundles. Minimized bundles can be used as 3D animated backgrounds on a website - Demo: ","category":"Design","language":"JavaScript","stars":4,"forks":0,"created":"2022-03-08T08:47:34Z","updated":"2023-03-06T02:14:29Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://mythemeway.github.io/Dark-Particle/","topics":["3d","animation","artist-tool","boilerplate","bundle","canvas","esbuild","glsl","glsl-shader","glslx","graphics-programming","live-coding","live-editor","shader","shader-editor","threejs","webdev","webgl","website-background","website-design"],"demo":"https://mythemeway.github.io/Dark-Particle/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T05:46:14.585Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T05:46:14.585Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T05:46:14.585Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T05:46:14.585Z","stars":4,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Three.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["This boilerplate allows you to develop quickly and easily WebGL canvas bundles. It has two modes. The result of production mode is a minimized bundle. You can embed this bundle as a 3D animated background on a website, for example.","In development mode, the GLSLX shader files are watched. That means, if you edit them and save your changes, the shaders will be recompiled and reloaded immediately. Feel free to adapt the existing shaders or create a completely new one. If you need inspiration, check out Shadertoy or GLSL Sandbox for fragment shaders and Vertexshaderart for vertex shaders. There you can see what's possible.","If you don't need this boilerplate but would like to embed the already minimized canvas bundles directly on your website, see the following."],"features":["GLSLX & prepr are integrated via esbuild-plugin-glslx Badges are clickable and linked to their sources.","Note: Cards are clickable and linked to the corresponding GitHub repositories."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/MyThemeWay/mtw-boilerplate-graphics/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"7a78f6ec85f7bfea563da3a6679dcc87d7cb55af26264b058f755570a6d1532b","extractedAt":"2026-10-10T05:46:14.744Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T05:46:14.744Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"This boilerplate allows you to develop quickly and easily WebGL canvas bundles. It has two modes. The result of production mode is a minimized bundle. You can embed this bundle as a 3D animated background on a website, for example.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/MyThemeWay/mtw-boilerplate-graphics/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"7a78f6ec85f7bfea563da3a6679dcc87d7cb55af26264b058f755570a6d1532b","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/MyThemeWay/mtw-boilerplate-graphics/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T05:46:14.744Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2023-03-06T02:14:29Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/MyThemeWay/mtw-boilerplate-graphics/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T05:46:14.745Z","hash":"7a78f6ec85f7bfea563da3a6679dcc87d7cb55af26264b058f755570a6d1532b","originalBytes":28845,"storedBytes":28845,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["canvas","check","out","path","prepr","twgl","const","mtw-canvas","src","there","nbsp","note","mode","mtw-boilerplate-graphics","bash","changes","copyright","license","null","brand","get","linked","minimized","names","readme","run","always","boilerplate","development","directory","fragment","logos","made","mtw-canvas-blacksea","mtw-canvas-disks","mtw-canvas-malachite","mtw-canvas-spiral","mystartupfile","npm","see","shaders","three","three.js","add","attribute","bundle","bundle.","bundles","clickable","contains","corresponding","default","file","glsl","included","install","legal","local","mtw-canvas-new","open","production","protected","